14. ### Our Approach: Structured Whitespace
15. Instead of boxing every element in a card, we use:
16. - **Semantic grouping** through spacing and alignment
17. - **Subtle dividers** (1px lines, background shifts) instead of full borders
18. - **Cards only for interactive or elevated content** (modals, dropdowns, key CTAs)
